<title>CHINA: Lianhua '96 net profit down 95.68 pct.</title>
<headline>Lianhua '96 net profit down 95.68 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	 207.506	  vs    248.908</p>
<p> Net profit	 0.8997	 vs     20.806</p>
<p> Asset per share    1.67  yuan   vs	1.70 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share 0.005 yuan   vs	0.12 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Lianhua Fibre Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: the results were released in a company statement on Thursday. All figures are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed no cash dividend or bonus share issue, pending approval at a shareholders' meeting.</p>
</text>
